<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-18T11:28:01.054Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:28:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to target civilians and security forces across Plateau and Zamfara, killing vigilantes, miners, a traditional ruler, and police officers in separate attacks. In Plateau, bandits killed four vigilantes and two miners, while gunmen shot the MACBAN chairman and the Miyetti Allah chairman, wounding them. In Zamfara, gunmen killed three police officers during a night patrol and three more in a separate patrol attack. Islamic State claimed responsibility for a deadly strike on a military camp. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNNVB5M05XYkRzSmp4MlBodDdaaExfQWVGUndjSHJQOG9DdHhiTnQ3TEU1UGE0UDMzUnNIUkFXWUxUTDExa0dvNEZZeWtDRHN2c3kxcHdUblRDamZXSFJkN0FBRE9WUGcxTXpKQ3R3dmR3LWh1bzN2Q3UyWmw2aXlyUExHQUNxdFlVS2dZTWExX0Z0M2Zhc3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQcnVMT01PVFVwck5LYUhQLXpOeTlJMXhQTnNCMWQtS2VsbEVJXzFjOVRpNWFWMExyV1p4SWpYaGIzUU81LXBkOVFqRGNDOG9LV3pTbTRDZnJwUl9uV3RadmZmdFhTZ1k3WlJ4V0YwZmszRFhpVkFQWHNheC00Sl9hUlp5Wm5pUUc4Z2dOSUxiRldxQXdfRzFyUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;TVC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQcmkxZUlaemhrRnFOTnlsZmlMZVpDYWRuMW9CNVVMZlY0SGtUUkYwbkZCaVVoRWN3bVd6Vi1kOVotMk55THBtZVBZNWlCNmo0MzdjVlNrNXlPNVNhci1EU3JqekJYWVFpYzNsS0xUZXplTURhZi1OR3R3cDExak5SdTRkeFhza2pjYk5jZ093SGdnaUdIbkY0c0pjY095VFU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE5zMW9WM1dPN1hGSWFCQlNzaXh6N0lqSmpHc25iVm91a09hejJsMW9nbmdaV2pCU2hwX1pPei13WEVsQ19jR3R4WW1vN3VDQWFCY3VjZWVOQXN4TnN4SFk3WDdIQ1FpVmUycE1IWndPbEM0b1c0ZWctanc5Nmk?oc=5&quot;&gt;TheCable&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV